@* Shown instead of the map when no Google Maps key is configured, with the
   exact command to set one. *@

<div class="card-panel map-fallback">
    <p>
        Google Maps API key isn't configured. From the
        <code>MelanomaDetection.Web</code> project folder, run:
    </p>
    <p><code class="map-fallback-command">dotnet user-secrets set "GoogleMaps:ApiKey" "your-key-here"</code></p>
    <p class="map-fallback-last">then restart the app.</p>
</div>
